  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "莎士比亞與電影",
    "sub_ename": "SHAKESPEARE ON SCREEN",
    "describe_ch": "提升學生英文的聽力與閱讀能力，使學生熟知莎士比亞經典影片的各種風格，促發學生欣賞與解析莎士比亞影片的能力，增進學生分辨與比較電影與文學文本異同的能力?其次，提升學生對莎士比亞影片、經典文學乃至全球文化的興趣與批判能力，引發學生對於精緻文化與文創趨勢的興趣?課堂中將引介與解析莎士比亞經典影片 – 如羅密歐與茱麗葉,仲夏夜之夢,哈姆雷特,馬克白,李爾王等 -- 不同版本的片段?課程也包括課外閱讀與小組討論的資料包括相關的影評與論文?",
    "describe_eh": "The course aims to enhance students' English listening and reading proficiency. To familiarize students with diverse styles of Shakespearean movies. Another goal of the course is to initiate students' ability to appreciate and interpret Shakespearean cinemas. Besides, I would also aim to improve students' ability to compare and differentiate the literary texts and cinematic texts in this course. It is also important to raise students' interest in and critical judgment on Shakespearean films, canonical literature and global culture in general and to enhance students' interest in the trends of fine culture and creative industries as well. \r\nFragments of canonical Shakespearean plays in diverse cinematic versions -- Romeo and Juliet, A Midsummer Night’s Dream, Hamlet, Macbeth, King Lear, etc. -- will be shown and analyzed in class. Movies reviews and critical essays related to the movies will be assigned for reading and group discussion.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "熟知莎士比亞經典影片的各種風格，增進學生對莎士比亞文本的認識，透過莎士比亞文本，反思當代社會問題、重新審視人與環境之間的和諧。",
      "describe_en": "1.\tIt will make students acquainted with various types of films adapted from Shakespeare’s plays, deepen their knowledge of Shakespeare’s texts, reflect on contemporary social problems, and re-examine the harmony between humans and their environments"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "開拓文化宏觀視野，尊重多元價值，進而進行價值的反思",
      "describe_en": "It broadens and deepens students’ cultural literacy, helping them understand how to respect cultural diversity and to cultivate their ability to reflect on it."
    }
  ],
